OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FThe odd morning shower is
OL,6,Fpossible across Kent. Otherwise, a dry
OL,7,Fand bright day for most on Saturday
OL,8,Fwith spells of sunshine. Feeling
OL,9,Fpleasant with temperatures near
OL,10,Faverage.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FA bright end to the day with
OL,13,Fsunny spells this evening. Mostly dry
OL,14,Fovernight with clear spells
OL,15,Fdeveloping. Chance of an isolated
OL,16,Fcoastal shower in the east of the
OL,17,Fregion.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
