OL,2,W+.-'"-$/*%*%*%/"-$/*%Q,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CSunday:FDry and settled for most on
OL,6,FSunday, with plenty of late August
OL,7,Fsunshine on offer. Chance of an odd
OL,8,Fshower across Kent during the morning.
OL,9,FLight winds and feeling warm.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:
OL,12,FRemaining largely dry with sunny
OL,13,Fspells on Monday. Showers and possibly
OL,14,Fthunderstorms developing on Tuesday,
OL,15,Fwith these becoming more widespread
OL,16,Fand heavier by Wednesday. Feeling
OL,17,Fwarmer, especially in the sunshine.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
